        "zh": "其將胡翼度曰：「軍勢宜集不可以分，若偏師不利，人心駭懼，胡可以戰！」",
        "idiomatic": "Hu Yidu, one of Shao’s generals, said, “We must concentrate our forces and keep them together. If a detachment suffers a reverse, the men will be seized with fear. How could we fight then?”",
